---
import Layout from '~/layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout title="404 Not Found" description="The page could not be found.">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <main class="relative flex min-h-[calc(100svh-76px)] items-center justify-center overflow-hidden px-5 py-16">
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/3 h-72 w-72 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-primary/20 blur-3xl"></div>
        <span
          class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 select-none text-[34vw] font-black leading-none tracking-tighter text-foreground/[0.035]"
          >404</span
        >
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-xl text-center">
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-dot">Lost in the void</span>
        <p class="mt-8 font-display text-[clamp(5rem,18vw,10rem)] font-extrabold leading-[0.8] tracking-[-0.08em] text-foreground">
          4<span class="text-primary">0</span>4
        </p>
        <h1 class="mt-6 font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">这一页去旅行了</h1>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          你寻找的页面不存在、已经被移动，或者暂时藏起来了。不如回到首页，重新出发。
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
          <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">回到首页 <span class="icon-[ph--house] size-4"></span></a>
          <button type="button" onclick="history.back()" class="btn btn-ghost">
            返回上一页
            <span class="icon-[ph--arrow-u-up-left] size-4"></span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>
